1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,118
You sit down to study at eight

2
00:00:03,118 --> 00:00:05,107
By nine, you've read one page

3
00:00:05,107 --> 00:00:07,152
and opened fourteen tabs

4
00:00:07,522 --> 00:00:08,923
So you install a blocker

5
00:00:08,923 --> 00:00:10,823
and it wants you to sign up

6
00:00:11,993 --> 00:00:13,884
Study Duo is a study timer

7
00:00:13,884 --> 00:00:16,247
that lives in your browser

8
00:00:16,247 --> 00:00:19,147
Free, offline, and it never phones home

9
00:00:19,717 --> 00:00:22,815
Your deadlines come in from your course calendar

10
00:00:23,285 --> 00:00:25,238
Pick one and press Start

11
00:00:25,908 --> 00:00:27,046
A small clock sits

12
00:00:27,046 --> 00:00:28,816
in the corner of every page

13
00:00:28,816 --> 00:00:30,726
and fades while you read

14
00:00:31,396 --> 00:00:35,210
Distracting sites stay closed until the block ends

15
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:38,813
Opening one anyway takes ten seconds and a reason

16
00:00:39,783 --> 00:00:40,898
Need some sound?

17
00:00:40,898 --> 00:00:42,778
White, pink or brown noise

18
00:00:42,778 --> 00:00:44,223
made right here

19
00:00:48,693 --> 00:00:50,061
Or play your own songs

20
00:00:50,061 --> 00:00:52,057
straight from your computer

21
00:00:57,927 --> 00:00:58,923
When time's up

22
00:00:58,923 --> 00:00:59,720
a bell rings

23
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:02,109
and the page tells you to rest

24
00:01:03,279 --> 00:01:05,711
One tap says how focused you were

25
00:01:06,581 --> 00:01:07,699
After a few weeks

26
00:01:07,699 --> 00:01:09,502
it knows your best hours

27
00:01:09,502 --> 00:01:12,314
and which songs actually help you focus

28
00:01:13,584 --> 00:01:15,822
Every block lands on your timeline

29
00:01:15,822 --> 00:01:17,623
ready for any calendar

30
00:01:18,393 --> 00:01:19,171
New laptop?

31
00:01:19,171 --> 00:01:21,223
Move your settings and to-dos

32
00:01:21,223 --> 00:01:22,968
over with a QR code

33
00:01:23,838 --> 00:01:26,041
No account, no server

34
00:01:26,041 --> 00:01:27,907
When we installed BlockSite

35
00:01:27,907 --> 00:01:31,005
it contacted fifty-six outside servers

36
00:01:31,005 --> 00:01:33,305
Study Duo contacted none

37
00:01:34,775 --> 00:01:35,643
Study Duo

38
00:01:35,643 --> 00:01:37,795
Free and open source
